GameModeText: {
	BrutalName: Brutal World
	AsuraName: Asura Hell
	AnnihilationName: Death's End
	GodSmithName: Divine Artifice
	BrutalOnLine: This world is cruel, and yet you love it still.
	BrutalOffLine: The world sheathes its fangs. Its mercy is only a pause.
	AsuraOnLine: The Asura path opens. Every pain you deal shall be repaid in full.
	AsuraOffLine: The Asura path closes. All debts are settled.
	AnnihilationOnLine: All shall pass; only Death lives forever.
	AnnihilationOffLine: Death rests a while; the living steal a breath.
	GodSmithOnLine: The Godsmith takes up the hammer; every common iron shall be reforged.
	GodSmithOffLine: The forge fire wanes; all arms return to their former shape.
	BrutalDesc: Unleashes the reworked, merciless AI of brutal foes, their stats anchored no lower than Master Mode; every enemy gains 50% more life and damage, and lesser fiends turn swift and frenzied
	AsuraDesc: The enhancement rises to 100%. Foes adapt to repeated damage of the same kind, and any blow you deal sets the least they deal back. Melee strikes resist adaptation, the blade itself most of all; the closer you strike, the more melee damage you deal
	AnnihilationDesc: The final form of Asura Hell in a For the Worthy world. Every terror doubles again: foes adapt twice as fast, and your pain is repaid twofold
	BrutalCreationDesc: Master is the floor: reworked bosses awaken, all foes empowered
	AsuraCreationDesc: Master is the floor: foes adapt to your blows and mirror your pain
	GodSmithDesc: Vanilla weapons are reforged with brand-new attacks, and vanilla armor sets gain an extra endowment true to their nature. Enemy strength is untouched, and it toggles independently of every other mode
	GodSmithRecastTitle: Godsmith Reforged
	GodSmithEndowPrefix: "Endowment: "
	StateOn: Active
	StateOff: Dormant
	HintEnable: Click to awaken
	HintDisable: Click to seal
	BossRefuse: A boss still lives. The pact cannot be altered now
	AsuraNeedBrutal: Awaken Brutal World first
}

SporeshineAmbience.DazeDeathReason: "{0} drowsed away deep in the spore haze"
WoodsongBrambleSystem.BrambleDeathReason: "{0} stepped into the forest bramble"
